  {
   "id": "CommandSystem_Notice",
   "text": {
    "en-US": "<b>Please read the following information carefully before using this command system.</b>\n\n<b>1.</b> Due to the limitations of Unity platform, this script engine is single-threaded. Therefore, the execution time and memory usage are unlimited. The code which contains dead loops or infinite recursions may cause your application to crash.\n\n<b>2.</b> This script engine can execute arbitrary code. It means that you can perform the following operations:\n- Manipulating the local computer's file system, e.g. file reading, writing, moving, copying, deleting, etc.\n- Create, access, or terminate processes and programs in the operating system.\n- Establish network connections and perform network operations.\n\n<b>Therefore, do not execute codes from unknown sources. If your computer system is hacked or damaged while executing unknown code, this application won't accept liability for that.</b>",
    "zh-Hans": "<b>在使用该指令系统前，请仔细阅读以下内容：</b>\n\n<b>1.</b> 由于 Unity 平台限制，该指令系统的脚本引擎仅在单线程运行。 因此，代码的运行时间与占用内存空间将不受限制。 如果您在代码中加入死循环、无限深递归等内容，可能导致应用卡死、闪退等结果；\n\n<b>2.</b> 该指令系统的脚本引擎为任意代码执行的。这意味着，您能够实施以下操作：\n- 操作本地计算机的文件系统，例如进行文件读写、移动、复制、删除等操作；\n- 创建、访问或者终止操作系统中的进程与程序；\n- 建立网络连接，进行联网操作。\n\n<b>因此，切勿随意执行来源未明、功能未明的代码。 如果您因为执行未知代码而导致计算机系统受到入侵、破坏，本应用将不承担任何责任</b>。"
   }
  },
